  "description": "A lightweight WPF MVVM framework built on CommunityToolkit.Mvvm and Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection, with Roslyn source generator support for zero-reflection View-ViewModel binding, single-page navigation, and dialog window service. Ideal for small to medium-sized applications.\n\t\t\t一个轻量级的 WPF MVVM 框架，基于 CommunityToolkit.Mvvm 和 Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection 构建，集成 Roslyn 源码生成器实现零反射视图绑定，提供单页面导航和对话框窗口服务。适用于中小型应用程序开发。",
