  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0 — Breaking changes from 1.x\n\nThis release is NOT backward-compatible with v1.2.8.\n\nBreaking changes:\n• SDK-style project required for .NET Framework 4.8 — legacy\n  packages.config + old csproj no longer supported\n• Removed build/*.targets — NuGet auto-loads analyzers from\n  analyzers\\dotnet\\cs\\\n• Removed packages.config — use PackageReference instead\n\nNew:\n• Integrated CT.Mvvm source generators ([ObservableProperty],\n  [RelayCommand]) — all Demo4 ViewModels converted\n• .NET Reactor config updated to preserve XmlnsDefinition\n  (fixes Release build WPF XAML compilation)\n\nSee CHANGELOG.md and docs/ for full details.",
